WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.076
- I caught a fish this big and now...

00:00:02.076 --> 00:00:04.020
- I'm going to jail!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.430
- Two fishermen have
been charged with crimes

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:06.330
after a cheating scandal

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.820
at the Lake Erie Walleye
Trail fishing tournament.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.710
After the tournament
director opened the walleye

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.680
caught by Jake Ryan and
Chase Kaminski, he shouted

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.940
- [Director] We got weights in fish!

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:15.773
- [Fisherman] There we go!

00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:16.620
- And as the viral video shows,

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.140
the fisherman loaded up their
catch with over seven pounds

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.270
of lead weights enabling
them to win the tournament

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.310
and the $28,000 prize.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.930
Other fishermen became
suspicious of the pair

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.850
after they dominated the
walleye fishing season

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:27.930
all year long.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.730
Ryan and Kaminski were indicted on charges

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.980
of attempted grand theft,
a fourth degree felony,

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.220
for trying to steal property,
valued at over $7,500.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.330
They were also charged with cheating,

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.800
possession of criminal tools,

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.930
and unlawful ownership of wild animals.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.300
The pair allegedly stuffed
other fish with fish filets

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.370
which is the basis for
the wild animal charge.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.840
The local prosecutors
described the conduct

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.210
as not only dishonorable,
but also criminal.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.820
No word on whether the
Lake Erie Walleye Trail

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.520
fishing tournament will ever
recover from the scandal.

